!3. Default, floating static default route

!P1
conf t
ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 10.2.1.1 
ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 10.2.1.2  10
end

!!where 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 is default gateway and 10.2.1.1(D1) is primary as this is the closest to P1 and 10.2.1.2(D2) is secondary and 10 as admin distance
!! admin distance default is 1 increment should be 5 or 10

!S1
